217
00:28:31.650 --> 00:28:46.439
Samuel Smith: And that Access Control API grants an entitlement to be signed to something to be signed. And then it's sent to the secure hardware. The secure hardware verifies the authorization to be signed, and then signs it and sends it back, right? And then…

218
00:28:46.760 --> 00:28:54.099
Samuel Smith: then you have an IT signing requester, which might be a frontline worker, not… not an IT person.

