248
00:34:03.860 --> 00:34:13.770
Samuel Smith: And so, from an actuarial perspective, you come up with a crypto period that says, you know, based on practice.

249
00:34:14.110 --> 00:34:26.870
Samuel Smith: It's a bad idea to, not rotate keys on a regular basis, because eventually, if you keep using the same keys, eventually you're going to have

