00:35:40.260 --> 00:35:55.949
Samuel Smith: for crypto periods, then you're not NIST compliant, and it says that in 857. To be NIST compliant, you have to use all of NIST's recommended things, which include 857, not just NIST-recommended crypto, but you must follow those best practices.

