00:42:53.980 --> 00:43:16.280
Samuel Smith: that it was issued as… when… during… when the keys were valid, and that it hasn't since been revoked or something happened to it. And so, then you know by the fact that it's anchored or logged, that you can still verify it, even though the keys have rotated. Well, that sounds a lot like…

