00:47:09.770 --> 00:47:25.080
Samuel Smith: that prophylactic rotation does not guarantee that you haven't been compromised. You don't know if you've been compromised. What you're doing is you're limiting the time period over which, if you were compromised, the compromiser could use a fraudulent issuance.

