00:47:25.080 --> 00:47:48.030
Samuel Smith: So you're base… this… this is one reason why PKI is going down to 47 days. Because actually, if you read the… the spec, it's not just 47 days… it's 47 days for the certificate, but it's going to be 10 days for… for the, the, the, the, I'm trying to think of the word they use… for the… for the, the critical information in the certificate.

